OL,3,GNEWSATeachers at private school to
OL,4,Astrike for six days
OL,5,
OL,6,FTeachers will go on strike "following
OL,7,Fthe ongoing failure of school
OL,8,Fmanagement" to act on their concerns
OL,9,Fregarding the way they are managed, a
OL,10,Funion has said.
OL,12,FWendy Exton, from the NASUWT, said
OL,13,Fteachers would walk out of Westonbirt
OL,14,FSchool, a co-educational independent
OL,15,Fschool, over changes to working
OL,16,Fconditions, a "lack of safe management
OL,17,Fin pupil number increases" and
OL,18,F"unsustainable" workloads.
OL,20,FThe dates of action have been listed as
OL,21,F14 October and 3, 4, 9, 10, and 11
OL,22,FNovember.
OL,23,APub: 05-OctQppppppppppppppppppppppG1/2
OL,24,ANext PageBW-SW Eng NewsC Reg TVFWeather
FL,348,340,200,160,0,100
